GENESIS webservice replies used as test fixtures. Three provenance classes, named by prefix:
- genesis-* / regionalstatistik-*: captured live with scripts/capture_genesis_fixtures.py, redacted (secret values in any
  case or URL-encoding replaced; username / password / Username fields replaced unless the value is the guest marker
  GAST or the server's own asterisk masking). "guest" runs sent no credential headers; "badcreds" runs sent a made-up
  user and password so the rejection texts could be recorded without a real account.
- documented-*: hand-written from the Anwenderdokumentation "Webservice/API" v5.1 (01.06.2026, Statistisches Bundesamt),
  https://genesis.destatis.de/datenbank/online/docs/GENESIS-Webservices_Einfuehrung.pdf; not captured.
- synthetic-*: written for the tests, no external source.
Not yet available (need working credentials; the GENESIS-Online webservice backend was degraded on 2026-08-16 and no
Regionalstatistik account exists yet): unknown-table, result-too-large, and job-accepted envelopes, metadata/table
replies for the pinned tables, and the three tablefile payloads. Their mappings are covered by synthetic status blocks in
the tests; replace them with captures via the script when credentials work.

